{"unit_id":"tag:04DJ:prose-0001","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n性质（A）的定义请见第<REF_0001>节。\n\n","allowed_english":["A"],"term_occurrences":[],"unknown_terms":[],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:04DK:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>为概形（schemes）的态射（morphism）。假设（A）。\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002>\n<MATH_0002>\n反映（reflects）单射（injections）和满射（surjections），\n<STRUCT_0003><MATH_0003>满射（surjective），对任意阿贝尔层（abelian sheaf）<MATH_0004>如此，其中它定义在<MATH_0005>上，\n<STRUCT_0004>\n<MATH_0006>\n忠实（faithful）。\n<STRUCT_0005>\n","allowed_english":["A"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"reflects","target_term":"反映"},{"source_term":"injections","target_term":"单射"},{"source_term":"surjections","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"abelian sheaf","target_term":"阿贝尔层"},{"source_term":"faithful","target_term":"忠实"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"reflects","target_term":"反映","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"injections","target_term":"单射","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"surjections","target_term":"满射","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"abelian sheaf","target_term":"阿贝尔层","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"faithful","target_term":"忠实","context":"待决"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:04DL:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>为概形（schemes）的分离（separated）局部拟有限（locally quasi-finite）态射（morphism）。则上述性质（A）成立。\n","allowed_english":["A"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"separated","target_term":"分离"},{"source_term":"locally quasi-finite","target_term":"局部拟有限"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"separated","target_term":"分离","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"locally quasi-finite","target_term":"局部拟有限","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"待决"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:04DM:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>为概形（schemes）的整（integral）态射（morphism）。则性质（A）成立。\n","allowed_english":["A"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"integral","target_term":"整"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"integral","target_term":"整","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"待决"}],"notes":[]}
