{"unit_id":"tag:04DO:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>为概形（schemes）的态射（morphism）。假设（B）成立。则函子（functor）\n<MATH_0002>\n将满射（surjections）变为满射（surjections）。\n","allowed_english":["B"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"surjections","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"surjections","target_term":"满射"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"surjections","target_term":"满射","context":"待决"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:04DP:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>为概形（schemes）的态射（morphism）。设\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002><MATH_0002>为平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）态射（morphism），它是概形（schemes）的态射，\n<STRUCT_0003><MATH_0003>为平展（<ACCENT_0002>tale）覆盖（covering），以及\n<STRUCT_0004><MATH_0004>为点（point）。\n<STRUCT_0005>\n假设对任意这样的数据，都存在平展（<ACCENT_0003>tale）邻域（neighbourhood）<MATH_0005>、不交并分解（disjoint union decomposition）<MATH_0006>及态射（morphisms）<MATH_0007>，它们在<MATH_0008>之上。则性质（B）成立。\n","allowed_english":["B"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0001>tale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0002>tale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"point","target_term":"点"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0003>tale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"neighbourhood","target_term":"邻域"},{"source_term":"disjoint union decomposition","target_term":"不交并分解"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0001>tale","target_term":"平展","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0002>tale","target_term":"平展","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"point","target_term":"点","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0003>tale","target_term":"平展","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"neighbourhood","target_term":"邻域","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"disjoint union decomposition","target_term":"不交并分解","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"待决"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:04DQ:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>为概形（schemes）的有限（finite）态射（morphism）。则性质（B）成立。\n","allowed_english":["B"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"待决"}],"notes":[]}
